    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardship</strong>\u00a0is a  survival-focused city builder, where managing people, resources, expanding your settlement and progressing through an in depth tech tree is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You'll gather materials, craft tools, buildings, and deal with the daily needs of your citizens.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every system ties into your town's ability to survive and grow, all within a changing environment with unseen dangers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/b805d93876ba96ba141c6f409dddd398.webp?t=1751098860\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your city in whatever style you would like. With a simple a blueprint system combined with a robust building system you can easily design your own houses, factories, workshops, taverns and place them anywhere on your planet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/86846aee09d6660ed1fda2c1d493e3f7.poster.avif?t=1751098860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/86846aee09d6660ed1fda2c1d493e3f7.webm?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/86846aee09d6660ed1fda2c1d493e3f7.mp4?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/e8d1b2083b6a9b7216cff79bbd18e46d.webp?t=1751098860\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Research technologies to advance your civilization all the way from primitive techs to electricity to modern technology like the internet.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/b5896a6ce7dc3e2f25eaefb2a6043a15.poster.avif?t=1751098860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/b5896a6ce7dc3e2f25eaefb2a6043a15.webm?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/b5896a6ce7dc3e2f25eaefb2a6043a15.mp4?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/4c5946446bc2cff658aa5c3ba4d36654.webp?t=1751098860\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunger, thirst, fatigue, and exposure to harsh temperatures will directly affect citizen health, morale, and productivity.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/ff398a5b768cee67726a062ebc4e9bf9.poster.avif?t=1751098860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/ff398a5b768cee67726a062ebc4e9bf9.webm?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/ff398a5b768cee67726a062ebc4e9bf9.mp4?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/04b2d1a8afa8eb58cf7768a5fcf66c0b.webp?t=1751098860\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect vital materials like wood, stone, food, and more. These resources are the backbone of your settlement and must be managed wisely to sustain your population and support construction efforts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/e9a7de6333f893f807047070e3839f21.poster.avif?t=1751098860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/e9a7de6333f893f807047070e3839f21.webm?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/e9a7de6333f893f807047070e3839f21.mp4?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/52d9cfccb5a98ad2db90346b43c7572f.webp?t=1751098860\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan your settlement layout, assign roles to citizens, and manage their tasks. A strong infrastructure and well-organized workforce are key to survival and expansion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/c2bd79c9c1dc8951ccd55bdd826349b9.poster.avif?t=1751098860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/c2bd79c9c1dc8951ccd55bdd826349b9.webm?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/c2bd79c9c1dc8951ccd55bdd826349b9.mp4?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/d5f2387ff736da20b8520ea1fdffd552.webp?t=1751098860\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set on a planet with a shifting day/night cycle and an approaching winter add a layer of strategy. Who knows what threats are lurking in this unfamiliar solar system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/168e31ddb1542531e7eb562e15dc1212.poster.avif?t=1751098860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/168e31ddb1542531e7eb562e15dc1212.webm?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/168e31ddb1542531e7eb562e15dc1212.mp4?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/6fb5bb0e3fd9b60992f1d1d611917e94.webp?t=1751098860\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip your citizens with the means of production and defense, from headgear and to  hammers. A well-equipped citizen is not only more productive but stands a better chance against the elements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/52161fd4f3aabb1730d8490f7095a930.poster.avif?t=1751098860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/52161fd4f3aabb1730d8490f7095a930.webm?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/52161fd4f3aabb1730d8490f7095a930.mp4?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just the beginning. This is my dream game and I have big plans for continued development, community feedback, and meaningful updates as the game grows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for checking out <i>Hardship</i>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardship</strong>\u00a0is a  survival-focused city builder, where managing people, resources, expanding your settlement and progressing through an in depth tech tree is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> You'll gather materials, craft tools, buildings, and deal with the daily needs of your citizens.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every system ties into your town's ability to survive and grow, all within a changing environment with unseen dangers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/b805d93876ba96ba141c6f409dddd398.webp?t=1751098860\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your city in whatever style you would like. With a simple a blueprint system combined with a robust building system you can easily design your own houses, factories, workshops, taverns and place them anywhere on your planet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/86846aee09d6660ed1fda2c1d493e3f7.poster.avif?t=1751098860\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/86846aee09d6660ed1fda2c1d493e3f7.webm?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/86846aee09d6660ed1fda2c1d493e3f7.mp4?t=1751098860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1334570/extras/e8d1b2083b6a9b7216cff79bbd18e46d.webp?t=17510988